                                "sense_id": "91e246f7-7f57-37db-bf30-3303f2ade7f5",
                                "text": "She put on airs, pretending to be more sophisticated than she was."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8f98ce6-a332-41c7-8da1-609e771e992e",
                                "sense_id": "91e246f7-7f57-37db-bf30-3303f2ade7f5",
                                "text": "He walked into the room with an air of confidence, though it seemed like just airs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fd4596d4-d57f-4bea-af4e-2b5ab69bdfb8",
                                "sense_id": "91e246f7-7f57-37db-bf30-3303f2ade7f5",
                                "text": "Stop giving yourself such airs—we all know you."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
